      "line": "^[a-z0-9.-]+$",
      "reason": "the same hagezi list where scripts/fetch-adblock.js writes it now (public/assets/blacklist.txt, gitignored, copied to dist/client/assets/blacklist.txt and fetched by src/lib/sw.js). Ad domains such as err.wisp.cat, bare.id and bare-character.com hit the word canaries wisp and bare. A line that is only a domain is a blocked host; any other hit in the file still fails"
