    "reason": "estrogen's VM keeps the names a classic script declares globally and every global it reads in plain text. A name built from one of these words names the proxy even when it is no canary, as getUV or SJ_PREFIX did. The gate splits each identifier in served scripts and inline page scripts at case changes, digits, _ and $ and fails on any part in this list.",
